---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout basePath="" title="FAQ — Ask Astro Raja">
  <section class="py-24 px-4 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <div class="text-brand-saffron-dark font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 text-sm">Common Questions</div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-6">Everything you need to <span class="text-brand-saffron">know</span></h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-brand-text-muted">Answers to the most common questions about Ask Astro Raja, Vedic astrology readings, privacy, downloads, and what the reports contain.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6">
      <!-- Question -->
      <details class="group bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:border-brand-saffron transition-colors">
        <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-bold text-xl text-brand-navy cursor-pointer list-none">
          What is Ask Astro Raja?
          <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180">
            <svg fill="none" height="24" shape-rendering="geometricPrecision" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="text-brand-text-muted mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed space-y-4">
          <p>Ask Astro Raja is an AI-powered Vedic astrology tool built for Tamil Nadu families, students, and professionals. You enter your Raasi (Moon Sign), Lagnam (Ascendant), and Nakshatra (Birth Star), answer four simple questions about your life, and receive a full personalized guidance report in minutes.</p>
          <p>Unlike generic horoscope apps, every report is generated fresh using authentic Vedic astrology principles applied to your unique birth chart combination and your current life situation.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
      
      <!-- Question -->
      <details class="group bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:border-brand-saffron transition-colors">
        <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-bold text-xl text-brand-navy cursor-pointer list-none">
          Do I need my exact birth time?
          <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180">
            <svg fill="none" height="24" shape-rendering="geometricPrecision" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="text-brand-text-muted mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed space-y-4">
          <p>No. If you already know your Raasi, Lagnam, and Nakshatra from a previous reading or family records, that is all we need. You do not need to know your exact birth time.</p>
          <p>However, if you want to <strong>calculate</strong> your Raasi, Lagnam, and Nakshatra for the first time, you will need your exact birth time. A Vedic astrology calculator (available free online) or a local astrologer can help you determine these details.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- Question -->
      <details class="group bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:border-brand-saffron transition-colors">
        <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-bold text-xl text-brand-navy cursor-pointer list-none">
          Is this real astrology or just AI-generated text?
          <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180">
            <svg fill="none" height="24" shape-rendering="geometricPrecision" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="text-brand-text-muted mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed space-y-4">
          <p>Both. The AI has been guided by a deeply crafted Vedic astrology system built by our founder, Astro Raja, who has 20 years of practice in traditional Vedic astrology.</p>
          <p>The AI applies <strong>real Vedic astrology principles</strong> — Nakshatra characteristics, Raasi and Lagnam interactions, planetary rulerships, and Dasha timings — to your specific inputs. What would take a human astrologer an hour to compose by hand, the AI produces in under a minute.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
      
      <!-- Question -->
      <details class="group bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:border-brand-saffron transition-colors">
        <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-bold text-xl text-brand-navy cursor-pointer list-none">
          Is my information private?
          <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180">
            <svg fill="none" height="24" shape-rendering="geometricPrecision" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="text-brand-text-muted mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed space-y-4">
          <p>Yes. Your inputs — name, birth details, and personal answers — are used <strong>only</strong> to generate your report. We do not store your personal data, build user profiles, or share your information with any third parties.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
